@startuml
title Rundler bundle sender — state machine
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #4A78B5
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #EEF5FF
  BorderColor #4A78B5
  FontColor #000000
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #4A78B5
}

[*] --> Building

Building : query the pool, filter by fees,
Building : gas cap and simulation
Pending : wait up to
Pending : max_blocks_to_wait_for_mine
Cancelling : build a hard or soft
Cancelling : cancellation operation
CancelPending : wait for the cancellation
CancelPending : to mine

Building --> Building : no candidate operations
Building --> Pending : bundle submitted
Pending --> Building : mined / dropped / abandoned
Building --> Cancelling : underpriced for more than\nmax_replacement_underpriced_blocks
Cancelling --> CancelPending : hard cancellation submitted
Cancelling --> Building : soft cancellation completed
CancelPending --> Cancelling : dropped / abandoned
CancelPending --> Building : mined, or max fee\nincreases exhausted

note right of Building
  Triggers: a new block, the
  bundle_max_send_interval timer,
  or debug_bundler_sendBundleNow
  in manual mode.
end note
@enduml
